# published — CLAUDE.md at the repo root, V1_PR_PROMPTS.md archived under
# docs/history/. They were previously listed here, which contradicted their
# tracked state; removed so ignore intent matches reality.
MODEL-THINK-RETRIEVAL-DEEP-DIVE.md
